  "body": "## Changelog\n* e9880262304cf639c1e9221017f4043da9635488 Skip local file reads when restarting Machines for secrets changes (#5583)\n* d0fc799defb9c5664db156b82bb44f3929d3842e Handle auto-destroyed Machines in `fly machine run --rm` (#5581)\n* 30e210321a033e22de2ff40655c7b79a0a152c67 Wait for all six Machines to start in the deploy-detach batching test (#5580)\n* 8cf08ccff40ce1358152e607c1317f4793133eea Start the agent when the config file doesn't exist yet (#5575)\n* 514470265f7d49db7978dbdb996fceab4ad343f6 Fall back to ordinary WireGuard peers when the session has no macaroons (#5574)\n* 76473cebc6c9cd303f35ae7bb5b0f64164199f24 Use the creation event ID when waiting in fly machine run (#5564)\n* e355c7b0489d24bcbeb7ca44fcf91ba4a5677540 Reuse the Depot worker hostname after the build (#5562)\n* 3c7f64a2740792d4bf5d30f91a8772ad22120c1f Recover `fly machine start` after a concurrent update (#5558)\n* a5f73d4c4601d5fe0ff5c3e68aee181daadfe4dc Allow pending login cleanup on Windows while the watcher is reading (#5559)\n\n"
}
